# Singletons for the QML files in this directory. Qt 6.4 does not embed a usable module
# qmldir for an executable, so Theme and Fmt would resolve to nothing on the device (they only
# worked next to the build tree, which has a copy). Qt 6.5+ does not need this file.
singleton Theme 1.0 Theme.qml
singleton Fmt 1.0 Fmt.qml
